            [
                'title' => 'A new Computer Literacy Center (CLC) founded at Narikel Baria ZA Secondary School, Jhenaidah',
                'slug' => 'narikelbaria-clc-establishment',
                'summary' => 'Recently Computer Literacy Program (CLP) founded a new Computer Literacy Center (CLC) at Narikel Baria ZA Secondary School, Jhenaidah on January 17, 2022. CLP has achieved another step forward in spreading computer literacy among Bangladesh&apos;s disadvantaged youth by establishing this CLC, reaching total 287 centers.',
                'description' => '<p class="work_para_news">Recently Computer Literacy Program (CLP) founded a new <a href="' . route("website.clcTeaching") . '">Computer Literacy Center (CLC)</a> at Narikel Baria ZA Secondary School, Jhenaidah on January 17, 2022. CLP has achieved another step forward in spreading computer literacy among Bangladesh&apos;s disadvantaged youth by establishing this CLC, reaching total <a href="' . route("website.schoolInfo") . '">287 centers</a>. The center is situated in Narikel Baria, a rural region in Bangladesh&apos;s Jhenaidah district. Md. Abu Jafar, a kind Bangladeshi presently residing in Canada, has extended his helping hand to disadvantaged students by sponsoring this CLC in this digital era, enabling them to pursue a modern educational life. </p><div style="box-shadow: 5px 5px 20px; border: 4px solid #f8f8ff;" class="embed-responsive embed-responsive-16by9"> <iframe class="embed-responsive-item" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/Bya_4Ss13fM?autoplay=0&mute=0" allowfullscreen></iframe> </div> <br> <p class="work_para_news">This school currently has an enrollment of 880 students, 409 of them are female. To convey modern computer educations to the students properly by CLC center’s teachers, a teacher training program was organized to train teachers. Under the guidance of trained teachers, 8 students from one batch will be able to learn fundamental computer skills with the help of “এসো কম্পিউটার শিখি (Esho Computer Sikhi)” book. </p> <p><figure><img src="' . asset('root/assets/images/news/narkel_baria-2.jpg') . '" alt="img" class="img-responsive"><figcaption class="work_para_news">Plaque of newly established CLC at Narikel Baria ZA Secondary School, Jhenaidah</figcaption> </figure></p> <p class="work_para_news">Computer education has become deeply essential for students in today&apos;s world. The headmaster of the school expressed his sincere gratitude to the sponsor for establishing and opening the door of computer literacy education for the disadvantaged students. He also praised the fact that more of his students will now be able to learn new computer lessons at the school.</p>',
