            [
                'title' => 'A remote teaching enabled smart classroom has been established at Taiyebunnesa Sadharan Pathagar located in Monohardi, Narsingdi',
                'slug' => 'taiyebunnesa',
                'summary' => 'A remote teaching enabled smart classroom was established on October 02, 2022 at Taiyebunnesa Sadharan Pathagar located in Monohardi, Narsingdi. In this very distant location, the library stands as the center for knowledge sharing. The remote teaching enabled smart classroom consists of 1 laptop, 1 50’ smart television, 1 webcam, 1 microphone and 1 HDMI cable.',
                'description' => '<p class="work_para_news">A remote teaching enabled smart classroom was established on October 02, 2022 at Taiyebunnesa Sadharan Pathagar located in Monohardi, Narsingdi. In this very distant location, the library stands as the center for knowledge sharing. The remote teaching enabled smart classroom consists of 1 laptop, 1 50’ smart television, 1 webcam, 1 microphone and 1 HDMI cable.</p> <p><figure><img src="'.asset("root/assets/images/news/tayub.jpg").'" alt="img" class="img-responsive"> </figure></p> <p class="work_para_news">This multimedia-equipped smart classroom will facilitate more collaborative and interactive learning among the learners and local people will be able to enhance their pursuit of knowledge by watching various educational and constructive videos in this smart classroom. Again, due to having internet connectivity in this newly established remote teaching enabled smart classroom, various expert teachers from the country and abroad will now be able to teach on various subjects which will play an important role in developing the youth society of this remote area.</p> <p><figure><img src="'.asset("root/assets/images/news/tayubp.jpg").'" alt="img" class="img-responsive"> </figure></p> <p class="work_para_news"> Dnet&apos;s representative instructed a teacher about the CLP program so that the CLP activities could be effectively carried out. Dr. Habiba Khatun, a kind Bangladeshi presently residing in the USA, has extended her helping hand to uplift this community with the digital facilities.</p>',
