                'title' => 'CONNECT STUDENTS AROUND THE WORLD (CSAW) PROGRAM HELD IN COLLABORATION WITH SHERUA ADARSHA HIGH SCHOOL AND GREAT OAKS LEGACY CHARTER SCHOOL',
                'slug' => 'connect-students-around-the-world-program-held-in-collaboration-with-sherua-adarsha-high-school',
                'summary' => 'Connect Students Around the world (CSAW) program was held on 5 th June. A collaboration between two countries on two sides of the world. The two participating schools are Sherua Adarsha High School(SAHS) Bangladesh and Great Oaks Legacy Charter School(GOLCS) Newark. Both schools share their stories in an online book creator platform. They share about themselves, their own tradition and their interests like their school, their village/city, sports, foods, music etc. They read each other;s stories and asked some questions. Which are then answered in a Zoom video conference.They participated in the Zoom conference on June 5, 2023 at 5 pm Bangladesh local time and 7 am local American time. After the zoom conference, they take part in informal conversations. Connect Students Around The World (CSAW) program brings together students from all over the world.This project showed how to build confidence, understanding and friendship between students living in two different corners of the world. CLP plans more similar projects in the future, using the lessons learned to benefit students around the world.',
